# 09 DEEP 并行任务包

## DEEP-A1 学习卡片 Worker

负责：

```text
backend/pk_radar/learning/cards.py
backend/tests/test_learning_cards.py
```

## DEEP-A2 复习算法 Worker

负责：

```text
backend/pk_radar/learning/review.py
backend/tests/test_review_scheduler.py
```

