## 并行约束

```text
每个 Worker 只改自己的文件
共同数据结构以 10_数据模型补充设计.md 为准
AI 生成内容不能直接 approved
外部内容必须先 quarantined
```


---

# 10 数据模型补充设计

## A线：人的学习系统表

### knowledge_cards

```sql
CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS knowledge_cards (
  id INTEGER PRIMARY KEY AUTOINCREMENT,
  source_chunk_id INTEGER,
  entity_id INTEGER,
  front TEXT NOT NULL,
  back TEXT NOT NULL,
  card_type TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT 'qa',
  difficulty INTEGER NOT NULL DEFAULT 3,
  scope TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT 'human_learning',
  review_status TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT 'candidate',
  created_by TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT 'human',
  created_at TEXT NOT NULL,
  updated_at TEXT NOT NULL
);
```

### review_events

```sql
CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS review_events (
  id INTEGER PRIMARY KEY AUTOINCREMENT,
  card_id INTEGER NOT NULL,
  rating INTEGER NOT NULL,
  elapsed_ms INTEGER NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,
  reviewed_at TEXT NOT NULL
);
```

### memory_strength

```sql
CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS memory_strength (
  card_id INTEGER PRIMARY KEY,
  stability REAL NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,
  difficulty REAL NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,
  due_at TEXT,
  last_reviewed_at TEXT
);
```

### learning_routes

```sql
CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS learning_routes (
  id INTEGER PRIMARY KEY AUTOINCREMENT,
  title TEXT NOT NULL,
  description TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT '',
  goal TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT '',
  scope TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT 'human_learning',
  created_at TEXT NOT NULL,
  updated_at TEXT NOT NULL
);
```

### palace_nodes

```sql
CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS palace_nodes (
  id INTEGER PRIMARY KEY AUTOINCREMENT,
  title TEXT NOT NULL,
  node_type TEXT NOT NULL,
  entity_id INTEGER,
  card_id INTEGER,
  x REAL NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,
  y REAL NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,
  metadata_json TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT '{}'
);
```

## B线：AI 调用系统表

### ai_candidate_memories

```sql
CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS ai_candidate_memories (
  id INTEGER PRIMARY KEY AUTOINCREMENT,
  content TEXT NOT NULL,
  source_type TEXT NOT NULL,
  source_id INTEGER,
  proposed_by TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT 'ai',
  trust_level TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT 'unknown',
  review_status TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT 'candidate',
  created_at TEXT NOT NULL
);
```

### task_packs

```sql
CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS task_packs (
  id INTEGER PRIMARY KEY AUTOINCREMENT,
  title TEXT NOT NULL,
  pack_type TEXT NOT NULL,
  content TEXT NOT NULL,
  source_project_id INTEGER,
  created_by TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT 'ai',
  review_status TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT 'candidate',
  created_at TEXT NOT NULL
);
```

## 隔离字段建议

所有核心表逐步增加：

```text
scope
trust_level
review_status
created_by
visibility
source_type
source_id
```


